===Etimologi===
Daripada <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q36395 site=mswiki</span></strong>, <i class="Latn mention" lang="enm">[[:februari#Bahasa&#95;Inggeris&#95;Pertengahan|februari]]</i>, <i class="Latn mention" lang="enm">[[:februare#Bahasa&#95;Inggeris&#95;Pertengahan|februare]]</i>, daripada bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q397 site=mswiki</span></strong>, daripada <i class="Latn mention" lang="la">[[:Februa#Bahasa&#95;Latin|Februa]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">Penyucian</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>, sebuah hari kebesaran Rom dua hari selepas ''[[ides]]'' (yakni pada 15 Februari), + <i class="Latn mention nowrap" lang="la">[[:-arius#Bahasa&#95;Latin|-arius]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">[[-ary]]: akhiran pembentuk kata sifat</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>. <i class="Latn mention" lang="la">[[:Februa#Bahasa&#95;Latin|Februa]]</i> daripada <i class="Latn mention" lang="la">[[:februum#Bahasa&#95;Latin|februum]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">penyingkiran</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>, daripada perkataan bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q65455885 site=mswiki</span></strong>, mungkin daripada bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q37178 site=mswiki</span></strong>, dan dengan itu, seasal dengan <i class="Latn mention" lang="en">[[:thio-#Bahasa&#95;Inggeris|thio-]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">bersulfur</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span> dan bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q35497 site=mswiki</span></strong> atau bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q37178 site=mswiki</span></strong>, peluasan akar <i class="Latn mention" lang="ine-pro">[[:Rekonstruksi&#58;Bahasa Indo-Eropah Purba&#47;dʰegʷʰ-|&#42;dʰegʷʰ-]]</i> <span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">(</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">“</span><span class="mention-gloss">bakar</span><span class="mention-gloss-double-quote">”</span><span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">)</span>, dengan itu seasal dengan <i class="Latn mention" lang="en">[[:fever#Bahasa&#95;Inggeris|fever]]</i> dan <i class="Latn mention" lang="la">[[:febris#Bahasa&#95;Latin|febris]]</i>. ''February'' ialah pelatinan yang menggantikan bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q36395 site=mswiki</span></strong>, daripada bahasa <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q35222 site=mswiki</span></strong>, dengan itu juga menggantikan <strong class="error"><span class="scribunto-error">Lua error in Modul:etymology/templates: Wikibase sitelink snapshot missing entity=Q42365 site=mswiki</span></strong>.
